WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.068 --> 00:00:05.230
A lot of snow fell overnight.

2
00:00:05.231 --> 00:00:12.219
"Let's play outside!" Harry said after breakfast.

3
00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:16.898
"Not so fast!" Dad said.

4
00:00:16.899 --> 00:00:21.081
"We have to shovel first."

5
00:00:21.082 --> 00:00:25.999
Harry frowned. "I hate shoveling."

6
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.267
"I like it!" Emmy smiled.

7
00:00:30.268 --> 00:00:36.160
"It's fun to help Dad outside!" Oliver said.

8
00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:41.716
The kids put on their warm clothes and went out.

9
00:00:41.717 --> 00:00:47.051
Harry and Oliver started shoveling the walkway.

10
00:00:47.052 --> 00:00:50.642
Emmy helped Dad with the driveway.

11
00:00:50.643 --> 00:00:56.667
Everyone was working hard.

12
00:00:56.668 --> 00:01:00.575
Oliver rolled some snow into a big ball.

13
00:01:00.576 --> 00:01:05.823
"This snow is perfect for making snowmen."

14
00:01:05.824 --> 00:01:11.872
"That means it's perfect for making snowballs too!" Harry said.

15
00:01:11.873 --> 00:01:16.883
He threw one at Oliver.

16
00:01:16.884 --> 00:01:21.681
Emmy dropped her shovel and scooped up some snow.

17
00:01:21.682 --> 00:01:24.768
"Let's have a snowball fight!"

18
00:01:24.769 --> 00:01:28.212
Emmy fired a snowball at Harry.

19
00:01:28.213 --> 00:01:32.041
But Dad moved, and she hit him instead.

20
00:01:32.042 --> 00:01:37.541
"Whoops!" Emmy said. "I was aiming for Harry."

21
00:01:37.542 --> 00:01:40.091
"No problem!" Dad said.

22
00:01:40.092 --> 00:01:45.999
He threw a snowball at Emmy.

23
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.957
"Harry, help me!" she cried.

24
00:01:49.958 --> 00:02:00.482
"Oliver, you're on my side!" Dad called.

25
00:02:00.483 --> 00:02:06.802
Snowballs flew back and forth until Harry noticed something.

26
00:02:06.803 --> 00:02:11.102
"We're making a mess!" he cried.

27
00:02:11.103 --> 00:02:18.300
"There's snow all over my nice, clean walkway!"

28
00:02:18.301 --> 00:02:23.158
Dad shivered. "I'm going inside to warm up."

29
00:02:23.159 --> 00:02:28.640
Harry handed a shovel to Dad. "Not so fast!

30
00:02:28.641 --> 00:02:34.242
We have to shovel first!"

